     A                                  5  1'THIS REPORT CHECKS ALL CODES WHERE'
     A                                  5 36'"AVAILABLE" (ONHAND LESS RESERVED)'
     A                                  5 71'IS LESS'
     A                                  6  1'THAN THE REORDER POINT TO SEE IF T-
     A                                      HERE IS SUFFICIENT ORDER QUANTITIES-
     A                                       TO'
     A                                  7  1'TAKE "AVAILABLE" BACK TO OR ABOVE'
     A                                  7 35'THE REORDER POINT.  THIS REPORT AC-
     A                                      TS AS'
     A                                  8  1'A "SAFETY VALVE" FOR THE REQUISITI-
     A                                      ON SYSTEM.'
