     A                                      ODE WILL HAVE A REQUISITION CREATED-
     A                                       THE'
     A                                 11  1'NEXT TIME "MA1" REQUISITION CREATE'
     A                                 11 36'IS EXECUTED.  IF IT DOES THEN THIS'
     A                                 11 71'CODE'
     A                                 12  1'DOES NOT NEED TO BE CHECKED.  ONCE'
     A                                 12 36'THIS CHECK IS MADE THE FOLLOWING Q-
     A                                      UANTITIES'
     A                                 13  1'ARE ADDED TO "AVAILABLE" AND THE R-
     A                                      ESULT IS COMPARED TO SEE IF IT IS'
     A                                 13 69'LESS THAN'
     A                                 14  1'THE REORDER POINT.'
     A                                 15 11'a) TOTAL STOREROOM ONORDER.'
     A                                 16 11'b) TOTAL STOREROOM OPEN REQUISITIO-
     A                                      N(S) QUANTITY INCLUDING THOSE'
     A                                 17 14'REQUISITIONS IN THE BATCH SHIPPING'
     A                                 17 49'RELEASE FILE.'
     A                                 18 11'c) TOTAL STOREROOM QUANTITY IN THE'
     A                                 18 46'BATCH SHIPPING RELEASE FILE THAT'
     A                                 19 14'IS NOT ON REQUISITIONS.'
     A                                 20 11'd) QUANTITY ON THE DOCK THAT IS NO-
     A                                      T YET STORED IN THE STOREROOM.'
     A                                 21  2'IF ("AVAILABLE" + a + b + c + d) I-
     A                                      S LESS THAN REORDER THEN THE CODE'
     A                                 21 70'WILL'
     A                                 22  2'APPEAR ON THE REPORT.'
